echo — echo arguments
======================

Reads the argument string and outputs it.
Used to test argument passing to external programs.

Reads directly from [[PROG_ARGS_ADDR]] like [[get_args]] but avoids constructing a
`string` in `main` (safer for the external-program / thread bootstrap path).

    module oskit.bin.echo

    import oskit.ulib.{puts, exit, get_args, skip_arg0}

    main()
        val args = skip_arg0(get_args())
        puts(args)
        puts("\n")
        exit()
